<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia BNA bank starts bond fund.</title>
<headline>Tunisia BNA bank starts bond fund.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's Banque Nationale Agricole has set up a new open-ended bond investment fund called SICAV-Placement Obligataire, bourse sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>The fund's initial capital was set at 300,000 dinars ($300,000). Subscriptions for private investors were already opened.</p>
<p>SICAV-Placement Obligataire will be Tunisia's seventh open-ended bond investment fund. ($=1.04 dinars) --Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
